{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.poster.avif?t=1769459505\" width=474 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.webm?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.mp4?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to bring this to Steam Frame.\u00a0 If we receive enough wishlists we can justify the financial costs to upgrade it to PCVR.<br><br>\u00a0Inspired by Dead By Daylight and Among Us, <strong>BlackGate</strong> is an asymmetrical multiplayer experience where every player has a unique role to play.\u00a0  Up to 4 Engineers are pit against an alien specimen controlled by a 5th player with one goal: Survival. \ud83d\udc7e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.poster.avif?t=1769459505\" width=488 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.webm?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.mp4?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an engineer, you and your team are sent to repair <strong>BlackGate</strong> station. Your mission is clear: restore power to the station, unlock crucial systems, and most importantly\u2014stay alive. Each engineer plays a crucial role in the survival of their team. \ud83d\udef0\ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.poster.avif?t=1769459505\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.webm?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.mp4?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Alien begins inside the nest deep within the ship, working its way towards its prey. As the specimen, your goal is simple but deadly. You start in a weak, larval form\u2014but every engineer you harm makes you stronger. \ud83d\udc7e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.poster.avif?t=1769459505\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.webm?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.mp4?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Once you evolve, you unlock new abilities\u2014like heightened senses to detect your prey, or faster movement, and deadly attacks. In your final form, you become an unstoppable force, capable of taking on the engineers head-to-head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670460?t=1769459505","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/af4fe630c4d555c9ab15b823746122705e28d390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769459505","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/9b24e457fff9cbea2791cfd409a7573f881ff24b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769459505","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/9b24e457fff9cbea2791cfd409a7573f881ff24b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769459505","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood, Gore, Horror elements. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.poster.avif?t=1769459505\" width=474 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.webm?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.mp4?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to bring this to Steam Frame.\u00a0 If we receive enough wishlists we can justify the financial costs to upgrade it to PCVR.<br><br>\u00a0Inspired by Dead By Daylight and Among Us, <strong>BlackGate</strong> is an asymmetrical multiplayer experience where every player has a unique role to play.\u00a0  Up to 4 Engineers are pit against an alien specimen controlled by a 5th player with one goal: Survival. \ud83d\udc7e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.poster.avif?t=1769459505\" width=488 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.webm?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.mp4?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an engineer, you and your team are sent to repair <strong>BlackGate</strong> station. Your mission is clear: restore power to the station, unlock crucial systems, and most importantly\u2014stay alive. Each engineer plays a crucial role in the survival of their team. \ud83d\udef0\ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.poster.avif?t=1769459505\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.webm?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.mp4?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Alien begins inside the nest deep within the ship, working its way towards its prey. As the specimen, your goal is simple but deadly. You start in a weak, larval form\u2014but every engineer you harm makes you stronger. \ud83d\udc7e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.poster.avif?t=1769459505\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.webm?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.mp4?t=1769459505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Once you evolve, you unlock new abilities\u2014like heightened senses to detect your prey, or faster movement, and deadly attacks. In your final form, you become an unstoppable force, capable of taking on the engineers head-to-head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["VRMonkey","Megaverse LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/ab3f94d49f945eb8e7a78758c1ee3d314edaf6c1/header.jpg?t=1769459505","is_free":false,"legal_notice":" BlackGate\u2122 and all characters, names, and elements are trademarks of and \u00a9 2025 Megaverse LLC, a Fun Train\u00ae company.<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3670460/382009712/80971d00c039ed667ccc4627f0438fad3d1db55b/1769457985/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769459497","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3670460/382009712/80971d00c039ed667ccc4627f0438fad3d1db55b/1769457985/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769459497","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3670460/382009712/80971d00c039ed667ccc4627f0438fad3d1db55b/1769457985/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769459497","id":257273